    "access": "RW",
    "unit": null,
    "description": "Incline motor parameters , 揚升馬達極性參數\n  bit4 - step  auto-initiation   (0/1: disable/enable)\n  bit1 - step  response polarity (0/1: smaller ADC value responses lower/higher step value)\n  bit0 - motor rotation polarity (0/1: ADC decreases/increases while forcing up)\n\n\nBIT01 BIT00 馬達極性\n0 0 馬達正轉，揚升ADC讀值下降，揚升高度下降\n0 1 馬達正轉，揚升ADC讀值上升，揚升高度上升\n1 0 馬達正轉，揚升ADC讀值下降，揚升高度上升\n1 1 馬達正轉，揚升ADC讀值上升，揚升高度下降\n",
    "note": "",
    "bitfields": []
  },
